<Slide style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', width: '1280px', height: '720px', padding: 0 }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 88, background: '#0E3F8C', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 40px', gap: 16 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 28, background: '#3D7BD9', borderRadius: 3 }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>Agent 系统架构</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', padding: '30px 40px', gap: 32 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1.2, gap: 8, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ padding: '12px 20px', background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 8, alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>自然语言输入</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#3D7BD9', textAlign: 'center' }}>↓</Text>
      <Box style={{ padding: '14px 20px', background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1.5px solid #3D7BD9', borderRadius: 10, gap: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>Agent 编排层</Text>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 8, flexWrap: 'wrap' }}>
          {['LLM 客户端', 'Prompt 工程', '校验兜底', '离线模板'].map((t, i) => (
            <Text key={i} style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '4px 10px', borderRadius: 6 }}>{t}</Text>
          ))}
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#3D7BD9', textAlign: 'center' }}>↓ design.json</Text>
      <Box style={{ padding: '14px 20px', background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1.5px solid #3D7BD9', borderRadius: 10, gap: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>KiCad 生成器（自研）</Text>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 8, flexWrap: 'wrap' }}>
          {['符号库', '原理图', 'PCB', 'BOM/网表'].map((t, i) => (
            <Text key={i} style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#4A5568', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '4px 10px', borderRadius: 6 }}>{t}</Text>
          ))}
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#3D7BD9', textAlign: 'center' }}>↓</Text>
      <Box style={{ padding: '12px 20px', background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 8, alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>.kicad_sch · .kicad_pcb · .kicad_pro</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, gap: 16, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>三级能力降级</Text>
      {[
        { n: '1', t: '自定义 LLM', d: '配置 API Key（DeepSeek / OpenAI / 通义 / Ollama）', c: '#1E4FA8' },
        { n: '2', t: '免费在线 LLM', d: 'BlockRun 开源模型，无需 key，开箱即用', c: '#1E4FA8' },
        { n: '3', t: '离线模板', d: '外网不通时按关键词匹配内置模板，保证跑通', c: '#8B97A8' },
      ].map((s, i) => (
        <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, padding: '16px 18px', background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #E5E7EB', borderRadius: 10, alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: s.c, width: 30 }}>{s.n}</Text>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1, gap: 3 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>{s.t}</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#4A5568' }}>{s.d}</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
      ))}
      <Box style={{ padding: '14px 18px', background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
          关键决策：单进程部署（FastAPI 同时托管 API + 前端），一条命令启动，打包简单。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0 40px' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>山东大学未来技术学院</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>07 / 13</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
